Algorithmes operations
variables
X, Y: réel

debut
	Ecrire("Entrez successivement la valeur de X puis de Y : ")
	LIRE(x, y)

	Ecrire(x, " + ", y, " = ", x+y)
	Ecrire(x, " - ", y, " = ", x-y)
	Ecrire(x, " / ", y, " = ", x/y)
	Ecrire(x, " * ", y, " = ", x*y)
	Ecrire(x, " mod ", y, " = ", x mod y)
	Ecrire(x, " div ", y, " = ", x div y)
	
fin
